{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33886","headline":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 四 · 皮日休","name":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静僻无人到，幽深每自知。\n鹤来添口数，琴到益家资。\n坏堑生鱼沫，颓檐落燕儿。\n空将绿蕉叶，来往寄闲诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}